Lyrics timeline skill: third-party models and software

This skill's own code is MIT licensed (see the repository LICENSE). It ships no model weights and
no third-party code. When the user agrees, scripts/setup.py downloads the models below and installs
the Python packages below into a private virtual environment under the plugin data folder. They are
not redistributed with the plugin; each stays under its own licence.

Models (downloaded on request, Apache-2.0 code and weights)
  Qwen3-ASR-0.6B and Qwen3-ASR-1.7B   Apache-2.0   https://huggingface.co/Qwen
  Qwen3-ForcedAligner-0.6B            Apache-2.0   https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-ForcedAligner-0.6B

Python packages installed by scripts/setup.py (pinned in requirements.in)
  qwen-asr 0.0.6        Apache-2.0
  torch                 BSD-3-Clause
  transformers          Apache-2.0   (pinned by qwen-asr)
  accelerate            Apache-2.0   (pulled in by qwen-asr)
  qwen-omni-utils       Apache-2.0   (pulled in by qwen-asr)
  librosa               ISC          (pulled in by qwen-asr)
  nagisa                MIT          (pulled in by qwen-asr)
  sox (Python wrapper)  BSD-3-Clause (pulled in by qwen-asr)
  numpy                 BSD-3-Clause
  scipy                 BSD-3-Clause
  soundfile             BSD-3-Clause (its wheels bundle libsndfile, LGPL-2.1)
  pypinyin              MIT

Packages that qwen-asr pulls in with other licences
  soynlp is declared as GPL-3.0 on its package page (a Korean tokenizer used by qwen-asr). It is
  installed only into the user's private virtual environment, is not part of this repository or of
  the plugin, and none of this skill's code imports it. gradio, flask and pytz are also pulled in by
  qwen-asr (Apache-2.0, BSD-3-Clause and MIT respectively) and are not used by this skill.

Excluded on purpose (licence)
  MMS models and ctc-forced-aligner defaults (CC-BY-NC-4.0), SOFA / HubertFA / SingAlign weights
  (non-commercial), whisper-timestamped (AGPL), SongPrep (academic use only), SongFormer and its
  MuQ dependency (non-commercial), TEN VAD (extra terms; this skill uses an energy and pitch gate).

Test-only dependencies (requirements-test.txt): pytest (MIT), numpy, pypinyin.
